     `ON-DEVICE NODE 12 RESOLVE SUCCESS: https://lightspeed.st/hls/ce181615-7914-4b8f-927c-eff91e855a39/1/master.m3u8`
3. **Manifest Rewriting & Range Proxying (`hls-proxy.js`)**:
